# 5) Documentation: describe the now-enforced custody rule.
patch('README.md',
'''If the external environment returns a real test file, fixture, CAD model, report, archive, or other artifact, the response declares it in `attachments`, the operator attaches the exact returned file, and the application verifies the actual bytes before the proposal can rely on that artifact. A filename, claimed SHA-256, code block, or repository path is not file possession.''',
'''If the external environment returns a real test file, fixture, CAD model, report, archive, or other artifact, the response declares it in `attachments`, the operator attaches the exact returned file, and the application verifies the actual bytes before the proposal can rely on that artifact. A filename, claimed SHA-256, code block, or repository path is not file possession. When a TEST has `ARTIFACT_REQUIREMENTS` other than `NONE`, the application derives `TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS` only from evidence linked to those verified bytes, and Stage 6 remains blocked until that canonical custody link exists.''')

# 6) Acceptance proof: direct ingestion linkage, gate failure, semantic/schema/UI coverage.
patch('verify-ingestion.mjs',
'''// Duplicate response is semantic, not whitespace-sensitive.''',
'''// A Stage 6 test that requires a returned artifact receives canonical TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS only from verified attachment bytes linked through evidence.\n{\n  const p=project('JOB-TEST-ARTIFACT-CUSTODY'),stage=6,pr=savePrompt(p,stage),e=validEnvelope(p,stage,pr),exactFile={artifactId:'ARTIFACT-TEST-FIXTURE-1',name:'test-fixture.bin',type:'application/octet-stream',size:4,sha256:'c'.repeat(64)};\n  const test=e.records.tests[0];test.fields.ARTIFACT_REQUIREMENTS='Exact executable fixture test-fixture.bin';test.evidenceRefs=['evidence-1'];e.attachments=[{temporaryKey:'test-artifact-1',filename:exactFile.name,mediaType:exactFile.type,byteSize:exactFile.size,sha256:exactFile.sha256,required:true}];e.evidence[0].attachmentRef={tempKey:'test-artifact-1'};\n  const prepared=ingestion.prepare(p,{stage,text:JSON.stringify(e),promptRecord:pr,files:[exactFile]});if(!prepared.validation.valid)throw new Error('Stage 6 verified test artifact fixture rejected: '+JSON.stringify(prepared.validation.issues));const proposed=prepared.proposal.canonicalRecords.tests[0];if(JSON.stringify(proposed.TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS)!==JSON.stringify([exactFile.artifactId])||JSON.stringify(proposed.fields.TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS)!==JSON.stringify([exactFile.artifactId]))throw new Error('Verified test artifact bytes did not become canonical TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS.');if(!prepared.proposal.changes.some(x=>x.canonicalCollection==='tests'&&x.canonicalField==='TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS'&&x.origin==='APPLICATION_RELATIONSHIP_RESOLUTION'))throw new Error('TEST_ARTIFACT_IDS lacks application-derived extraction provenance.');\n}\n\n// Duplicate response is semantic, not whitespace-sensitive.''')
